{
  "_comment": [
    "A local development fixture, not production data. Point",
    "VITE_REQUISITION_SCHEMA_URL at /requisition-schema.sample.json to work on the",
    "requisition form without n8n. In production this exact shape is served by n8n,",
    "which reads GET /api/v2/list/{id}/field from ClickUp and maps each field onto",
    "the keys below. Option UUIDs are deliberately absent: the app submits labels,",
    "and n8n resolves them against the live workspace.",
    "The form no longer asks for section, job grade or job code — HR assigns those —",
    "so they are not listed here and are sent as null.",
    "TODO(kenafric): six of these fields do not exist in ClickUp yet — location,",
    "othersReportingIndirectly, jobOverview, keyResponsibilitiesOutcomes,",
    "relevantSkillsExperienceAttributes and requisitionRaised. Until they do, n8n",
    "lists them in missingKeys and the form refuses to open.",
    "People come from the two directory endpoints (VITE_EMPLOYEES_WEBHOOK_URL and",
    "VITE_USERS_WEBHOOK_URL), not from this file. See kenafric-*.sample.json."
  ],
